      <p class="_abstract">Configure Keystone authentication in OpenShift Container Platform to share sign-in with your OpenStack Keystone server. Mapping users by Keystone ID reduces access risk when usernames are reused.</p>
      <p>Map OpenShift Container Platform users to Keystone usernames or unique Keystone IDs. Users log in with their Keystone username and password.</p>
