      <h2 id="identity-provider-creating-secret-tls_configuring-keystone-identity-provider" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating the secret<a href="#identity-provider-creating-secret-tls_configuring-keystone-identity-provider" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can create a TLS <code>Secret</code> object in the <code>openshift-config</code> namespace by using the <code>oc</code> CLI or by applying a YAML file to store client certificates and keys that identity providers require for secure communication.</p>
